"cannot be found to remove it: the group and the zone are kept (without it, "
"the service would no longer start). Run “omega-serv synchro groupe-service "
"retirer --service-name {subject}” from its folder, then run again."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"le service {subject} ({detail}) prendra en compte le groupe omega-synchro à "
"son prochain redémarrage : omega-connect ne le redémarre pas."
msgstr ""
"the {subject} service ({detail}) will take the omega-synchro group into "
"account at its next restart: omega-connect does not restart it."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{subject} figure au registre mais hors de la zone : ignoré."
msgstr "{subject} is in the registry but outside the zone: ignored."

msgid "la zone est déjà figée : rien à faire."
msgstr "the zone is already frozen: nothing to do."

